		(title "Calcumaker 16 — RGB Matrix")
		(date "2026-07-07")
		(rev "0.1")
		(company "calcumaker authors")
		(comment 1 "Programmer's/technical arbitrary-precision RPN calculator")
		(comment 2 "RGB dot-matrix display module: 96x24 1mm WS2812 (cluster->row->board) + RP2040 + unified SPI (DRAFT)")
	)
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Calcumaker 16 - RGB Matrix (NESTED MULTI-CHANNEL: cluster -> row -> board).\nRow1..Row3 = 3 instances of led_row.kicad_sch; each led_row = 12 instances\nof led_cluster.kicad_sch (8x8 = 64x XL-1010). Grid 96x24 = 2304 px. Shared\nglobals VLED (gated) / GND; DIN/DOUT are hier pins chained cluster->cluster\nthen row->row: CHr_DATA -> Row_r -> CHr_END. RP2040 PIO drives 3 data lines\nvia RGBPower's quad shifter; RGBPower gates VLED off in sleep. Wire the\none-off sheets in eeschema. Same unified SPI connector as the 7-seg board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
